{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道いま！\n今日１日いろいろやってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝見つけたポスターの抜粋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～～～～～～～～～～～\n私、上から読んでも下から読んでも\n「ごまたまご」なんです。\n～～～～～～～～～～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ、同士よ(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて\n明日の告知の前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( ゜_ゝ゜)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペット飼ってる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nいまは飼ってないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小１～３くらいのころ\n「「あい～んちゃん」」という名の\nハムスターを飼ってました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラコンいれてる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nいれてませんよ・ｏ・\nてかチキンでいれられません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/shock.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←\n視力悪くてコンタクトはいれてるけど\n普通のやつです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ＭＤなんですけどどうしましょう？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nわかるよ！\n乃木坂みんな可愛いもんね！\nでも迷うくらいなら\nかなりん推しになるしか～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちを推しても\n後悔はさせないよ｀・ω・´ドヤッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルファンの心得は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n推しに全力で愛を捧げる！\nこれに限ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥から私信きてぁぁぁぁあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てことで\n北海道がんばります｀・ω・´"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/rock.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"札幌駅 西コンコースイベントスペース\n13:00～13:20 トークショー\n13:20～ 握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださる方\n待っててください(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき\n生駒ちゃんたちに\nいたずらされました(｀´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…可愛いから許す！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい(-ω∩).zZ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}